<title>NETHERLANDS: OPTIONS -- EOE given late boost by ABN purchase.</title>
<headline>OPTIONS -- EOE given late boost by ABN purchase.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch options received a late boost as ABN AMRO announced its takeover of Standard Federal Bank of the U.S.</p>
<p>Some traders said the ABN AMRO announcement left certain market-makers scurrying to cover shorts in Jan 100 and Jan 105 calls.</p>
<p>Others said the rising share market had simply encouraged the public to buy calls in quality names, notably financials.</p>
<p>Total volume was not remarkably high, but the sharper gains of the share market in the afternoon spurred further call activity. -- Amsterdam newsdesk +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
